<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines 10-year T-bond coupon 13.875 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippines 10-year T-bond coupon 13.875 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The coupon rate of the Philippines' 10-year Treasury bond fell to 13.875 percent from the previous auction's 14.125 percent, the Bureau of Treasury said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Traders were expecting the coupon to between 13.25 and 13.5 percent.</p>
<p>Total tenders were 5.65 billion pesos but the auction committee awarded only 3.5 billion.</p>
<p>Accepted bids ranged from 12.75 percent to 13.875 percent averaging 13.528 percent.</p>
<p>--Manila Newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
